# UpCloud Provider

The UpCloud Terraform Provider enables organisations to control resources provided by the [UpCloud](https://upcloud.com/) platform.

## Configure provider
### Using environment variables
Set your API token in the `UPCLOUD_TOKEN` environment variable. To use a
subaccount's username and password instead, set the `UPCLOUD_USERNAME` and
`UPCLOUD_PASSWORD` environment variables.  
